Of course.

47
00:04:01,740 --> 00:04:06,740
It really is delicious. You're a wonderful cook. I'll give you that much.

48
00:04:06,740 --> 00:04:09,280
Got that right.

49
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:13,280
Oh, dear. What a shame we were sitting here talking so long that my soup seems to have gotten cold.

50
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,280
Sorry, I'll go reheat it for you.

51
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:19,280
There's no need to walk all the way to the kitchen. It'll be much easier to warm it up with your magic.

52
00:04:19,280 --> 00:04:21,280
Go on.

53
00:04:21,280 --> 00:04:33,820
Okay. I'll need your flame magic, Mother, and I hope you won't mind lending me your spatial magic as well, dear.

54
00:04:33,820 --> 00:04:51,360
Ah, thank you. That's much better. That catalyst magic of yours really does come in handy.

55
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:57,360
I wish I could borrow other people's magic to use for my own purposes. That's a valuable skill.

56
00:04:57,360 --> 00:05:03,360
It certainly is. My, that's good.

57
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:20,900
Run away!

58
00:05:20,900 --> 00:05:22,900
Mommy! Help us!

59
00:05:22,900 --> 00:05:24,900
Help us!

60
00:05:24,900 --> 00:05:33,440
Human scum.

61
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:38,440
Prepare to suffer the wrath of the elves. Vengeance will be ours.

62
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:44,440
Don't worry. I'll save you, I swear.

63
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:50,980
Please, get us out. And hurry or we'll die.

64
00:05:54,980 --> 00:05:57,980
C'mon, Dasu.

65
00:05:57,980 --> 00:06:22,520
It's too early for the sun to be rising.

66
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:35,060
Curse you, human.

67
00:06:35,060 --> 00:06:55,100
Look at that. It's the captain of the Golden Dawn's magic.

68
00:06:55,100 --> 00:06:55,600
Beautiful.

69
00:06:55,600 --> 00:07:14,320
That must mean the kingdom is saved, right?

70
00:07:14,320 --> 00:07:44,300
To be continued...

71
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:45,580
Read this.

72
00:07:47,340 --> 00:07:48,920
The Devil's Servants?

73
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:54,660
It says some of the Magic Knights were recently suspected of communicating with a Devil and using forbidden spells.

74
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:58,000
The accused will soon face trial by the Magic Parliament.

75
00:07:58,960 --> 00:08:00,680
That attack we suffered...

76
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:04,300
It looks like it was just one of many incidents that affected the entire Kingdom.

77
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:11,380
Rumor has it, the only reason they did all of those terrible things was because a powerful Devil assumed possession of their bodies.

78
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:12,240
Somehow.

79
00:08:12,740 --> 00:08:13,300
What?

80
00:08:13,300 --> 00:08:14,960
What? They were possessed?

81
00:08:16,260 --> 00:08:16,880
A Devil?

82
00:08:17,960 --> 00:08:18,880
Read this.

83
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:32,700
I'm asking each one of you to make sure your squads are as strong as you can.

84
00:08:32,700 --> 00:08:37,780
We only have six months, but please do everything possible to raise their stages to one.

85
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:43,260
We must defeat Spade to protect the residents of Heart, as well as our own Kingdom.

86
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:46,100
Does this arrangement work for you?

87
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:47,780
How do you mean, sir?

88
00:08:47,780 --> 00:08:54,540
As we established, the Magic Knights need to train for the next six months in order to be successful in their battle against the Devil.

89
00:08:55,700 --> 00:09:02,100
Asta's still waiting to receive a sentence, but surely you can table that decision until after this is dealt with, yes?

90
00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:04,680
I suppose I don't object.

91
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:07,260
What is the meaning of this?

92
00:09:07,260 --> 00:09:09,300
What is the meaning of this?

93
00:09:09,300 --> 00:09:11,640
Asta of the Black Bulls?

94
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:13,360
And that damned Narrow Woman?

95
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:15,480
They're servants of the Devil!

96
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:18,400
We can't let them roam free for six months!

97
00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:24,540
As I explained before, what matters right now is that we cooperate with the Heart Kingdom and the Magic Knights.

98
00:09:24,940 --> 00:09:29,240
It's crucial that we maintain a unified front in the face of that Devil and the Spade Kingdom.

99
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:29,820
Sir!

100
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,220
It's already decided.

101
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:36,120
Forgive me for saying so, Lord Domnazio, but I can't believe that you'd approve of this!

102
00:09:36,660 --> 00:09:37,840
That's because I don't.

103
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:41,440
However, there are many complicated factors in play here.

104
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,440
More important things.

105
00:09:43,580 --> 00:09:46,920
The only thing more important is executing the Devil who caused this mess!

106
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:50,960
There are multiple parties to blame for what the Eye of the Midnight Sun did to our kingdom!

107
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:53,340
But that Devil was at the root of it all!

108
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:55,840
They killed my nephew, sir!

109
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:57,000
Enough.

110
00:09:57,260 --> 00:10:00,760
I'm sorry, sir, but we need to put these vicious criminals to death!

111
00:10:01,140 --> 00:10:03,500
It's the only way for us to protect our people!

112
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,960
The magic bar limit is supposed to be—

113
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:06,320
Silence!

114
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:11,520
Right.

115
00:10:11,820 --> 00:10:13,020
I'll take my leave.

116
00:10:16,920 --> 00:10:23,580
The Wizard King has Lord Domnazio wrapped around his little finger.

117
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:27,120
We can't let the Devil's servants go unpunished for half a year.

118
00:10:27,540 --> 00:10:28,360
That's insane.

119
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:32,140
The scales of justice have tipped into the darkness.

120
00:10:32,860 --> 00:10:35,140
It's up to me to bring them back into the light.

121
00:10:35,520 --> 00:10:37,260
For the sake of the Clover Kingdom.

122
00:10:38,020 --> 00:10:38,900
Is that him?

123
00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:40,280
Yes, I'm certain of it.

124
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:43,860
He hates the Devil more than anyone else in the magic parliament.

125
00:10:44,700 --> 00:10:45,600
Then let's go.

126
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,300
Excuse me, sir?

127
00:10:50,220 --> 00:10:52,160
Are you Cowboy, by chance?

128
00:10:53,500 --> 00:10:54,880
Yes, my name is Cowboy.

129
00:10:55,340 --> 00:10:57,040
I'm sorry, but do I know you?

130
00:10:57,500 --> 00:10:59,260
No, we haven't had the pleasure.

131
00:11:00,180 --> 00:11:02,420
We were hoping you could spare some time to talk.

132
00:11:02,420 --> 00:11:05,960
Uh, actually, I'm a little busy right now.

133
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:09,980
I lost my family when the Eye of the Midnight Sun attacked our village.

134
00:11:10,820 --> 00:11:11,660
And not just them.

135
00:11:12,640 --> 00:11:13,800
Many lives were lost.

136
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:15,580
Everything burned down.

137
00:11:16,220 --> 00:11:17,340
I'm sorry to hear that.

138
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:21,440
There are countless others in our kingdom who suffered terribly after what happened.

139
00:11:22,420 --> 00:11:23,940
Yes, we're well aware.

140
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:27,220
And we also know that you endured the same pain.

141
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:30,480
You lost someone precious to you as well, didn't you?

142
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:31,920
How do you know that?

143
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:35,200
We're looking for revenge for all the victims.

144
00:11:35,660 --> 00:11:38,240
And we're going to need your help to achieve it.

145
00:11:38,560 --> 00:11:39,720
You want me to help?

146
00:11:40,220 --> 00:11:41,800
What do you intend to do?

147
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:50,420
My intent, or ours rather, is to destroy the Devil's servants with our own hands.

148
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:52,120
The Devil's servants?

149
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:54,040
Are you serious?

150
00:11:54,820 --> 00:11:57,260
I'll need to hear your plans in a bit more detail.

151
00:11:58,260 --> 00:11:58,940
Of course.

152
00:11:58,940 --> 00:12:00,140
Let's discuss.

153
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:14,720
In the wake of the Eye of the Midnight Sun's attack, Order was returning to the capital.

154
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:19,300
Wizard King Julius Novacrono was swamped with paperwork from the rebuilding effort.

155
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:24,700
Meanwhile, the Magic Knight squads each engaged in their own vigorous training regiments,

156
00:12:24,700 --> 00:12:28,680
in preparation for their coming battles with the Spain Kingdom and the Devil.

157
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:31,580
Hurry up!

158
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:32,220
What's wrong?

159
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:34,200
Quit stalling and come at me!

160
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:37,280
It's nothing.

161
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:39,780
But a little water would be pretty good right now.

162
00:12:40,220 --> 00:12:41,920
Why don't we take a break for a while?

163
00:12:42,140 --> 00:12:43,800
But I'm not thirsty at all, though.

164
00:12:43,800 --> 00:12:46,140
I say it's time for a water break.

165
00:12:46,260 --> 00:12:48,060
And I'm royalty, so I'm right!

166
00:12:48,540 --> 00:12:50,080
You're always bringing that up.

167
00:12:50,400 --> 00:12:52,720
What does you being royalty have to do with anything either way?

168
00:12:53,100 --> 00:12:55,920
I said I need a break, so I'm gonna take a break, okay?

169
00:12:56,420 --> 00:12:56,720
Hmm.

170
00:12:56,980 --> 00:12:59,620
If you're not thirsty, then don't come with me, idiot.

171
00:12:59,880 --> 00:13:02,080
I'm not sure what she's getting so mad at me for.

172
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:02,880
Do you know?

173
00:13:03,580 --> 00:13:03,980
Nope.

174
00:13:03,980 --> 00:13:06,520
Ah, well, might as well work out then, huh?

175
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:14,220
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten, eleven!

176
00:13:14,940 --> 00:13:21,460
Oh, hey, you guys.

177
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:23,620
Man, water sounds good right now.

178
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:24,980
Think you could pour me a glass?

179
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:26,720
No, pour it yourself.

180
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:28,700
You know I outrank you.

181
00:13:28,700 --> 00:13:32,140
It's quieter than usual.

182
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:35,740
That's because everybody's been out there training, except for Henry.

183
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:37,820
And you, slacker.

184
00:13:38,100 --> 00:13:39,940
I'm just taking a quick water break.

185
00:13:40,220 --> 00:13:41,080
And what about you?

186
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:43,860
Were you off spying on your sister like you usually do?

187
00:13:44,060 --> 00:13:44,820
What was that?

188
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:46,000
I mean, uh...

189
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:48,680
Since you asked, I had to help train this miscreant.

190
00:13:48,980 --> 00:13:52,280
With that done, now I'm off to keep watch over my perfect angel.

191
00:13:53,340 --> 00:13:55,480
Keeping watch, is that what you call it?

192
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:56,640
Man, I'm beat!

193
00:13:56,640 --> 00:14:00,920
We could make a great combo spell with my spatial magic and his mirror magic.

194
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:03,600
But the timing's been crazy hard to nail down.

195
00:14:04,040 --> 00:14:07,480
I have to cleanse the filth from my body before I see my angel.

196
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:12,040
I can't offend her senses by showing up drenched in sweat.

197
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:16,560
Sister Teresa doesn't come back from her trip till tonight.

198
00:14:17,220 --> 00:14:19,620
There was some big meeting for all the sisters in the church.

199
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:23,020
So I guess Ghosh wants to go visit Marie before she gets home.

200
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:25,920
And apparently I'm the lucky one who gets to go with him.

201
00:14:26,640 --> 00:14:28,400
Well, when the cat's away, right?

202
00:14:31,660 --> 00:14:33,820
We'll be together again soon, Marie.

203
00:14:37,820 --> 00:14:38,680
Hi, Ghosh.

204
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:40,820
Will you need some help washing your back?

205
00:14:41,240 --> 00:14:43,780
And after that, you can help me wash my back as well.

206
00:14:43,780 --> 00:14:52,320
How long can he keep doing that?

207
00:14:52,900 --> 00:14:54,560
He's already been at it for a while.

208
00:14:54,660 --> 00:14:56,140
He must be starting to get hungry.

209
00:14:58,280 --> 00:15:01,380
I'm not a cook, but I know I can at least make a sandwich.

210
00:15:01,380 --> 00:15:06,020
Heads up, Marie!

211
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,400
It's coming your way!

212
00:15:07,760 --> 00:15:08,400
Got it!

213
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:09,940
Nice kick!

214
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:11,960
There.

215
00:15:12,300 --> 00:15:13,380
That must be her.

216
00:15:14,900 --> 00:15:15,420
Indeed.

217
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:17,120
Marie Adlai.

218
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:19,180
Daughter of a disgraced noble.

219
00:15:19,660 --> 00:15:21,200
Her brother is a former criminal.

220
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:23,860
And she herself was possessed by a devil.

221
00:15:24,300 --> 00:15:27,240
She caused grave harm to many innocent people in the attack.

222
00:15:27,660 --> 00:15:31,260
We need to take care of this before the old hag from the church returns.

223
00:15:31,980 --> 00:15:32,500
Agreed.

224
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,120
Pardon me.

225
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:43,720
Come with me, servant of the devil.

226
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,320
You brat.

227
00:15:48,020 --> 00:15:50,040
Just what do you think you're trying to pull?

228
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:51,960
You are going to try and grab her.

229
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:54,280
We're not going to let anybody take our friend.

230
00:15:54,380 --> 00:15:54,960
That's right.

231
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:55,700
Back off.

232
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:56,640
Damn kids.

233
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,160
Who are these people?

234
00:15:58,680 --> 00:15:59,600
I'll go get help.

235
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:01,280
Sister Teresa, come quick.

236
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:03,640
She still hasn't come back from her trip.

237
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:05,540
Someone's trying to take Marie.

238
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:09,180
Who are you guys?

239
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:10,800
Leave them scared.

240
00:16:11,100 --> 00:16:12,080
Remember the name.

241
00:16:12,520 --> 00:16:14,260
We are the devil banishers.

242
00:16:14,780 --> 00:16:15,560
Step back.

243
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:17,900
I won't let anyone lay their hands on these kids.

244
00:16:18,500 --> 00:16:19,360
Snow magic.

245
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:20,760
Go snow cry.

246
00:16:27,180 --> 00:16:29,940
Of course they would show up when this sister's out of town.

247
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:32,000
Four of them?

248
00:16:32,560 --> 00:16:33,340
Snow magic.

249
00:16:35,220 --> 00:16:36,520
There's one behind me.

250
00:16:36,520 --> 00:16:38,080
Why didn't I sense any mana?

251
00:16:42,500 --> 00:16:43,020
Nish!

252
00:16:43,140 --> 00:16:43,660
Stop!

253
00:16:43,900 --> 00:16:44,540
Get off!

254
00:16:44,620 --> 00:16:45,300
Let me go!

255
00:16:45,300 --> 00:16:46,340
Come on, baby!

256
00:16:46,340 --> 00:16:47,980
Get me down right now!

257
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:49,860
Guys, stop it!

258
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:50,420
Hurry!

259
00:16:50,680 --> 00:16:51,440
Leave me alone!

260
00:16:52,240 --> 00:16:55,260
You won't be escaping again, servant of the devil.

261
00:16:55,260 --> 00:17:00,060
Why do you think I'm a servant of the devil?

262
00:17:00,120 --> 00:17:02,440
The scale is tilting to darkness.

263
00:17:02,860 --> 00:17:04,320
We must push it toward the light.

264
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:06,540
